          <h2 class="header-2 text-4xl aero text-center">My stance
          on AI</h2>
          <div class="p-4">
            Simply put, I do not use AI in my work. That means I do
            not use it to generate code, I do not use it to help me
            write posts, I do not use it when making art. I have
            worked hard to study and practice my skills, I would
            rather spend a lifetime creating something I am proud
            of than spending an afternoon generating stolen
            garbage.<br>
            <br>
            I am not a luddite, I understand that AI is here and it
            will not go away. However, I do not support it being
            used to replace skill or jobs. I believe that all
            people have the potential to express themselves, and
            that AI generative tools reduces the passion of
            creativity down to a product meant to be created
            quickly. It is not created cheaply, as the <a href=
            "https://mit-genai.pubpub.org/pub/8ulgrckc/release/2">cost
            of running generative AI technologies</a> is
            inexcusable, and contributes to the destruction of our
            planet and the erosion of our livelihoods.
          </div>
        </section>
